   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pending-tx tracker (pendingTxsSlice, persisted + synced across tabs)\nSIGNATURE_PROPOSED \u2192 'Signing'\n  cleared by SIGNATURE_INDEXED \u2190 txQueueListener (URL Safe's queue)\nEXECUTING \u2192 'Submitting' \u2192 PROCESSING \u2192 'Processing'\n  watched by useTxMonitor (URL chain's provider ONLY)\nRELAYING \u2192 'Relaying' \u2192 waitForRelayedTx (same chain filter)\nPROCESSED \u2192 'Indexing'\n  cleared by SUCCESS \u2190 txHistoryListener (URL Safe's history)",
   "originalText": "Pending-tx tracker (pendingTxsSlice, persisted + synced across tabs)\nSIGNATURE_PROPOSED \u2192 'Signing'\n  cleared by SIGNATURE_INDEXED \u2190 txQueueListener (URL Safe's queue)\nEXECUTING \u2192 'Submitting' \u2192 PROCESSING \u2192 'Processing'\n  watched by useTxMonitor (URL chain's provider ONLY)\nRELAYING \u2192 'Relaying' \u2192 waitForRelayedTx (same chain filter)\nPROCESSED \u2192 'Indexing'\n  cleared by SUCCESS \u2190 txHistoryListener (URL Safe's history)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e76",
