   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Space tx tracker (NEW, mounted only on space pages) \u2014 same pendingTxsSlice + same TxEvents, new producers\n\u2022 On each space-queue response: SIGNATURE_INDEXED when the signer left missingSigners\n\u2022 Watch PROCESSING / RELAYING for chains the global _app monitor is NOT watching (avoid double receipts)\n\u2022 INDEXING \u2192 SUCCESS: poll getTransactionById(chainId, txId), or tx gone from the space queue\n\u2022 Same nonce, different txId on that Safe \u2192 clearPendingTx\n\u2022 Refetch space query on SIGNATURE_PROPOSED / PROCESSED / SUCCESS; CGW busts space cache on tx-service events",
   "originalText": "Space tx tracker (NEW, mounted only on space pages) \u2014 same pendingTxsSlice + same TxEvents, new producers\n\u2022 On each space-queue response: SIGNATURE_INDEXED when the signer left missingSigners\n\u2022 Watch PROCESSING / RELAYING for chains the global _app monitor is NOT watching (avoid double receipts)\n\u2022 INDEXING \u2192 SUCCESS: poll getTransactionById(chainId, txId), or tx gone from the space queue\n\u2022 Same nonce, different txId on that Safe \u2192 clearPendingTx\n\u2022 Refetch space query on SIGNATURE_PROPOSED / PROCESSED / SUCCESS; CGW busts space cache on tx-service events",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e147",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
