   "text": "UNCHANGED (Safe level)\n/transactions/queue page\nGET /v1/chains/{c}/safes/{a}\n/transactions/queued\ntxQueueSlice \u00b7 useTxQueue\ntxQueueListener \u00b7 txHistoryListener\n_app useTxPendingStatuses\n+ useTxMonitor",
   "originalText": "UNCHANGED (Safe level)\n/transactions/queue page\nGET /v1/chains/{c}/safes/{a}\n/transactions/queued\ntxQueueSlice \u00b7 useTxQueue\ntxQueueListener \u00b7 txHistoryListener\n_app useTxPendingStatuses\n+ useTxMonitor",
